Cell["\<\
These seems out of control. A key notion however is that these pictures \
should be considered up to some equivalence - it shouldn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t \
matter what way the universe presents a surface to us. The equivalence is \
generated by isotopy and handlesliding.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.916205265681133*^9, 
